READ-ONLY RULES (hard-coded in agent.py + prompts.py)
• NO ingestion-trigger tool exists.
• NO modification to observations / forecast_runs / ingestion_log.
• Staleness → report with refresh instructions (scheduled task / pull_upag_dash).
• Numbers from tools only; redaction replaces unknown ₹/% with "…".
• Forecast range capped at 180 days.
• Graph 3 (supply balance) = AP ONLY.
• confidence_score = uncalibrated placeholder (k=1.2) — must say so.

